The files in this directory are cut-outs of Knoop by Knoop's published cycling network data of
2026-11-08 (graph, courses and path data), made with `pipeline cut` for the tests in
`RealRideTest`, see the change `replay-rides-on-real-data`.

They are derived from OpenStreetMap data:
© OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0,
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

Unlike the rest of this repository, which is under the Apache License 2.0, these files are under
the ODbL.

Areas (south, west, north, east):
- titz             50.985, 6.40,  51.02,  6.51    06 → 08
- siegburg-zange   50.765, 7.145, 50.81,  7.24    01, 02 (two signposts at the Sieg bridge), 28
- rhine-luelsdorf  50.755, 6.965, 50.835, 7.135   83, 12, 21, the ferry Lülsdorf–Wesseling, 20
- veluwe-43        52.14,  5.865, 52.195, 5.935   43, a knot tagged on four nodes
- lohmar-siegburg  50.765, 7.145, 50.86,  7.26    06 (Lohmar), 02, 28, the way from Dreesch to 06
